# MCPB bundle exclusions (MCPB_PACKAGING_STANDARDS.md S2.4).
# The pack pipeline wipes + recopies src/ -> mcpb/src/ before pack; these
# patterns keep venvs, webapps, tests, data, and editor dross out of the bundle.
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
web/
webapp/
src-tauri/
target/
tests/
test/
data/
*.sqlite3
*.db
*.db-*
.env
dist/
reports/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.bak
*.bak.*
.git/
.github/
.vscode/
.idea/
